    "preview_guide": "Registered StructureStartPreviewGuide body 0x3445b0 calls 0x490f0 at PC 0x344818. 0x490f0 builds a generic request and calls 0x49360/actor-manager routines. This is a preview actor creation candidate; the actor class/resource, model, collider, and exact spawn destination are not bound in this scan.",
