    "bounded_string_search": "Searched indexed string_refs for direct-call descendants (maximum 3 direct BL edges) from the four EventFlow bodies and all five strategy setup/result method pairs: 1,029 known function bodies, 0 references to pbc, collider/collision, StructurePreview/StructureActor, ModelName, .bfres or .sarc. This is bounded to indexed strings and direct BL edges; indirect calls/resource tables can still bind those assets."
